{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_savage_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_savage_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"沉痛转机","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_savage_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"1d4a21bddf50ab9bf15130e933c7219cc4d1c9de289fd6974dee5efbc765b441","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:03 P.M. 天气/晴朗\n钢铁萝卜城城外矿区 26号矿井"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，老约翰。下井结束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"累死了，拉我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我这可是干净衣服......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么好嫌弃的，你还不是，下一班就要到下面去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"找我有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"安保人员到了，过来问问下面的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"能有什么情况，我带的班，这么多年出过什么岔子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"让安检员直接去和下一班班长交接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去痛快地洗个澡，他们安保部门的想等我就老实等着吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......哟，意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是小姑娘嘛。长途旅行回来啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，顽固老头儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫长途旅行......我可是去正经工作的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"别那么严肃嘛。我知道，你是派驻到巴别塔那边交接，顺便跟着干大事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年，见了不少世面吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么大不了的......换个地方待着罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我的工作也涉及不到什么核心内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你也真是，现在知道回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道是上头还是巴别塔出了什么事，本来合作得好好的，突然就那样，说结束就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......老实说，我也毫无头绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。回过家了没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"已经报过平安了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候回来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"三天前......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，以前，你原先在保安部的同事们都升官了，现在你是被调回他们的手下了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，这么着急就上岗，巴别塔那边的事情已经全都处理好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么这副心事重重的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没想追着你问，想说什么就说好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，明明好不容易回了老家，见到老同事们了，却不高兴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然很想念你们，尤其是家乡的矿区对我来说这么熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......总觉得，结束得太快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"（吹口哨）看你这样子，还说没拿到好差事呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，遇到了什么离不开的心上人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哪、哪有什么心上人——是朋友啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......而且，我也没做什么值得称道的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是听说你接的是个大活儿啊。陆陆续续挖出那些“货物”可花了咱们两年的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"工人们都觉得，肯定是外面发生了什么事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"工程量的确不小。不过，我只负责很普通的环节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"这次合作里，为了确保从雷姆必拓送往巴别塔的“货物”运输安全与顺利交接，有必要派遣安保人员进行对接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样，将由我们这儿的矿业公司开采到的舰体和核心，不断送往交付到巴别塔的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，作为安保人员，我参与了一部分和巴别塔的合作工作，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，你真的什么都不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）老头，你不是不知道，我这个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你这姑娘......（叹气），还是一如既往，在关键的时候糊里糊涂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，萨卡兹的事情让他们自己去解决吧！关键时候糊涂了，或许也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果不是巴别塔吸引你，还能有什么理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......以前，我十分确信，自己会在矿场中生活一辈子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"没有关注外界的必要，可以说对外界一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是离开了次雷姆必拓，有了到外面去转转的机会嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，刚离开的时候，你还嚷嚷着不想走呢。所以说，年轻人啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老头儿，我......认识了一个同族的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，在周围都是萨卡兹的生活环境中，想要健康地成长是多么困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但她选择了接受。她学会了忍耐、坚持，始终怀揣着希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"她还有许多需要学习的知识，所以总是缠着我问各种各样的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"她喜欢我做的料理，对雷姆必拓的寓言故事特别着迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"一只小兔子。她来自哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......雷姆必拓。但是，她不会再回来了。所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实，我也不知道，自己为什么会这么担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这还不简单——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你想保护她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，保护她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是现在不是时候。我没有理由再留在那，也没有带领她前进的本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，现在我该做的，应该是回到雷姆必拓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这么看来，你已经找到自己的使命了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也没有那么严肃。毕竟，要是我执意留在巴别塔，别人又不想雇我，我不就可怜地失业了嘛！哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，现在就做自己该做的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我们工人在矿场里的性命安全，都托付在你们安保人员身上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是你，伙计们看到你都会放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"至少现在，我们需要你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，老头儿，今天你的话很多啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，对你不一样。你现在是见过世面的人，我可不敢随便再摆架子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，别开这种玩笑嘛——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"所以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你从那么远的地方回来，该不会把卡特斯的传统美德都忘记了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？什么美德？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你个小姑娘......礼物，当然是纪念礼物了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我没条件离开雷姆必拓，没办法出去见识见识。你们这些年轻人，有着这么好的机会，转眼便把我给忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，骗你的，我怎么会忘记嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"回来的时候，想着也不知道有没有下次出门的机会，我特地买了好几大箱货物亲自搬回来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"给。这是维多利亚卖得最好的助听器，专门送给你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这就对了嘛，不枉我和你过去搭班那么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"有了这个，听孩子们说话就更清楚了。唉，这麻烦的职业病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是。那我下去检查啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_u_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，这熟悉的感觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"闷热到窒息的防护服，又重又硬的工人帽，出了汗连擦一擦都做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"在这种艰难的环境里不断地开采，冒着生命危险和源石作伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"族人的生命，全部都消耗在了这些越藏越深的矿井里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——过去，这就是我生活的全部。和族人们一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的数年，未来的日子，我都会这么度过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"不行不行，想这么多也没有意义。我得好好工作，至少......现在我肩负的，便是老约翰他们这样的工人的生命安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......不免还是会想......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"narration","text":"两年后\n1:34  P.M. 天气/炎热\n钢铁萝卜城城外矿区 27、28、29号矿井"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快、快撤退！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"粉尘快要爆炸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃、呃啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命、咳、咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静下来，全部带上氧气瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命、救命啊——"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，这个警报声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是重大危险警报......矿井出事了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"报告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好了，27、28、29号矿井发生活性源石粉尘爆炸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧......！我就说，这该死的天气不能开工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就为了那点产量——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"29号井......那不是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"人员伤亡情况呢？现场是什么状况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有、有工人被埋在坍塌的矿井里！确认有伤员！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*雷姆必拓俗语*，暴行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快去救援。我去控制现场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——把防护服都穿上，和我出发！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈、哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"挖......到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子，还活着吗，老头子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"——老约翰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住！握住我的手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"疼......好疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"撑住，老头子，你还有救！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"把他拉出来，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......醒醒，老约翰！你不能睡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"暴行，离医疗帐篷还有三百米！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"冲刺过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我们是本次矿井事故的联合应急医疗小组。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓矿业公司的安保小组，哈、哈......伤员......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，立即安排安置伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"能否先和我们登记信息，需要立即联系亲属......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"公司这边会立刻安排，麻烦你们先治疗他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"托马斯，你留下来负责登记和联络部门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的人和我走，还有没被救出的伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我和另外两名同事是这次登记的志愿应急救助小组，来自罗德岛制药公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（罗德岛？没有听说过的公司......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"好，罗德岛的。老头子就......交给你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......请务必救下他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会尽力而为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......走，我们去救下一个！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"人数对上了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不敢置信，难得连尸体也找齐了。受伤12人，重伤3人，死亡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就算我不说，也没人比你知道得更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......从现场的源石粉尘浓度看，受伤的人大概都会很危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"救助站。我要去看看老头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"对了。这次参与救助的志愿者中，有一些医疗人员来自“罗德岛”。部长你有听说过这个组织吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛？......没有听说过，大概是新成立的公司吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓安保部长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去吧，正好也检查一下。顺便去看看那个罗德岛是什么来头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问您是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是安保部门的人吧！之前运送第一批伤员的也是您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我暴行就好。我来看看伤员的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......刚才，有一位登记叫做约翰的伤员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是约翰先生吗？请您放心，医疗干员已经为约翰先生做过应急处理了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"他......伤得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是，源石结晶刺入了他的手臂和侧腹，防护服因此被割破，随后吸收到的源石粉尘含量也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他已经确定感染了，是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......可恶。还是没赶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，已经为约翰先生做过了应急处理，使用了罗德岛的注射药剂之后，已经避免了进一步感染扩散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？......可是，伤到这种程度，又是活性源石结晶直接刺入伤口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白您的顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我暴行就好。你刚才说，用了你们的注射药剂之后已经避免扩散了，这是真的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，暴行小姐，目前运送到救助站的伤员，都已经根据受伤程度和感染程度使用了相应的应急药物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"失血过于严重的病人还未脱离危险，但是患者的源石感染症状已经基本抑制住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"都抑制住了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，全部......有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，只是，哪怕是效果好上一些的药剂，也不是能给工人们立即使用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"在雷姆必拓现存的医疗组织中，所使用的廉价源石感染应急药物对已经感染的工人作用十分有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"但是罗德岛却......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是志愿援助小组没错吧？这些应急药剂不便宜，用量也很可观，你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我，我并不负责这一部分......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我向您保证，约翰先生已经脱离了生命危险，不久后就能接受探望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"不一样......一旦成为感染者，工人们的命运就已经被决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"被迫成为更加廉价的劳动力，去到已经枯竭的矿井做最辛苦和危险的尾料收集工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，患者被送到的时候，大多已经......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"该说对不起的是我。抱歉，明明你们已经做得足够多了......非常感谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐，我......我明白您的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希主任曾教导我们，哪怕伤口可以愈合、矿石病感染得以抑制......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦成为感染者，对于社会的大部分人来说，仇恨和偏见就已经不可理喻地形成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。凯尔希的确是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，你们的主任是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是凯尔希女士。她可是我们罗德岛所有医疗干员的榜样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希......主任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你们的领袖呢？罗德岛，你们罗德岛组织的领袖叫什么名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她，呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，拜托你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的首领，罗德岛组织现任领袖，她的名字是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿米娅”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿......米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......请问，有什么问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会是阿米娅......如果真的是她，现在她的年龄也不过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是的，我们的领袖十分年轻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......只要和阿米娅进行过一次交流便会知道，她拥有超越年龄的智慧和坚强的意志，是一位真正优秀的领导者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐您会知道这些......莫非，是阿米娅小姐的旧识？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯，我们......从很久以前就是好友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们能联系到阿米娅吗？只要说出我的名字，她一定会明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。阿米娅小姐的确说过，她有十分亲密的好友，现在或许就在雷姆必拓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"真的，真的是阿米娅......我能去见她吗？应该怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在就去联系罗德岛的信使。还有，暴行小姐，如果您有什么话想要带给她......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ri_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"十五日后\n钢铁萝卜城郊区 救助站 感染者病房内"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......知道自己成了感染者的一瞬间，我甚至在想，是不是死了之后获得的抚恤金能让家里人过得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想着......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，我第一件想到的事情，是问自己，该用什么表情面对我的家人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"老婆和孩子都不喜欢我生气的样子，更不可能喜欢我哭丧的脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，见到他们的时候，我真的笑得出来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不像你，老头儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"谁不知道，你可是方圆十公里最乐观的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"连你都耷拉着耳朵去见家人，弟兄们又该怎么面对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是，就是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老约翰这愁眉苦脸的样子，把大家心情都搞坏啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那是你们没有一群孩子要养，不知道其中的苦难。生活可难着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷姆必拓工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们以后的日子也难着呢——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，暴行，你别再接他们的话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经想好了，继续在雷姆必拓做工的待遇实在养不活家里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"等病好起来，我们干脆就去哥伦比亚，大家一起加入“大拓荒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老头......你真的准备离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"当我是雷姆必拓矿业的矿工的时候，我就是最勤奋、最卖力的工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我是感染者了，不管还剩多少日子，我也要让家人一直过幸福稳定的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有想过，只要雷姆必拓的矿一天不挖完，这样的往复的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人，每个时代，都有着不得不肩负的使命和责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来不为自己成为一个矿场工人羞愧。在雷姆必拓，没有人会这么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"但是暴行，几年前你离开雷姆必拓，两年前又回来后，你的想法变了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，你从小就不是个普通兔子。每个人都有自己的使命和责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你的锤子救了我们的命，接下来的日子，你也会拯救更多的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有必须要保护的人，那就离开吧。我也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，看你那表情。其实你早就决定好了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得好像我是个无情的家伙嘛，老头儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，这是我一定要去做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"我有必须保护的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"终于......我又找到她，能够见到她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是一份绵薄之力，为了她，我也会倾尽所有的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哪有什么值得“倾尽所有”的事情，都是你们年轻人太天真了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......说得好像当初为了家人下井、现在要为了家人离开的人不是你。你不也是拼尽全力，倾尽所有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哪一样？我这是养家糊口......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"是是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你准备什么时候出发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"今天。再最后来看一看你，然后就要启程了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年里，有你的帮忙，我们才没出什么事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是这次，也是你救出了还活着的我们......感激不尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"说这些可就让我没法谦让了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老头，可要好好珍惜我救下的命，把接下来的日子过好哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"臭丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老约翰","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"再见。老约翰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"（......暂时要告别了，雷姆必拓。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，久等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"暴行小姐，已经完成道别了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"老头也真是......到最后还提醒我，让我回家里再认真告别一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天回家和父母道别的时候，母亲可还在念叨着“下次回来也该有对象了”呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_230_savage","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这是为了事业！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真是其乐融融呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"和本舰沟通后快速办理的入职申请已经通过了。这些是人事招聘合同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"详细的工作事务就在抵达本舰后交接吧，罗德岛十分欢迎暴行小姐您的到来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......暴行小姐，一路顺风。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......终于，终于。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你变成什么样了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"已经成长为领袖了，真了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"等着我吧，阿米娅。不论发生了什么，现在肩负着什么样的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我有好多想告诉你、想和你分享的故事。你会想听吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"这两年里，你遇到的快乐的事情、难过的事情，我遇到的快乐的事情、难过的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"在见面以后，来尽情诉说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["暴行","罗德岛医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_230_savage","aliases":["暴行","老约翰"]}]}
